<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- components.head %>
<body class="site-shell skin-<%= page.skin %> voting-page" data-branch="<%= page.branch %>">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>
    <%- components.nav %>
    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <main id="main-content" class="page-shell" tabindex="-1">
            <div class="container page-content voting-content">
                <p class="mono voting-eyebrow">COMMUNITY INPUT</p>
                <h1 class="section-title">Development votes</h1>
                <p class="voting-intro">Help me choose what to focus on next.</p>
                <div class="noir-card voting-rules">
                    <p>I open polls with priorities I can reasonably consider. Each account gets <strong>one equal vote per poll</strong>. A confirmed vote is final for that poll; a new poll gives you a new vote.</p>
                    <p>Results guide my decisions. They do not promise a feature, a release date or that the winner will be built. Supporting the work does not add votes or buy roadmap control.</p>
                    <p>Only totals are public. Your choice is visible to you and stored with your account. <a href="<%= siteRoot %>privacy/#development-votes">Voting privacy</a>.</p>
                </div>
                <p id="voting-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading polls…</p>
                <noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to load polls and vote. <a href="<%= siteRoot %>account/">Your existing account</a> is used to sign in.</p></noscript>
                <div id="voting-polls" aria-label="Development polls"></div>
                <p id="voting-sponsor" class="voting-fine" hidden></p>
                <section id="voting-admin" class="noir-card voting-admin" aria-labelledby="voting-admin-title" hidden>
                    <h2 id="voting-admin-title">Manage polls</h2>
                    <p>Create a draft, review it, then open it when you choose. Drafts are private. Closed polls stay closed.</p>
                    <form id="voting-draft">
                        <label for="poll-title">Poll title</label>
                        <input id="poll-title" name="title" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="off">
                        <label for="poll-description">What this choice influences</label>
                        <textarea id="poll-description" name="description" required maxlength="1500" rows="3"></textarea>
                        <label for="poll-options">Feasible priorities, one per line (2–8)</label>
                        <textarea id="poll-options" name="options" required maxlength="1295" rows="5" aria-describedby="poll-options-help"></textarea>
                        <p id="poll-options-help" class="voting-fine">Each option can have up to 160 characters. No automatic poll schedule is set.</p>
                        <button class="btn-noir" type="submit">Save private draft</button>
                        <p id="voting-admin-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
                    </form>
                    <div id="voting-admin-polls"></div>
                </section>
                <p class="voting-fine">One account is not proof of one person. Account and request limits reduce abuse; they cannot prevent someone creating multiple accounts.</p>
            </div>
        </main>
        <%- components.footer %>
    </div>
    <script src="<%= siteRoot %>scripts/script.js"></script>
    <script src="<%= siteRoot %>scripts/light-engine.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
